      "id": "2121438414729838879",
      "text": "This is the ninth consecutive game that Antetokounmpo and Adebayo each have at least eight rebounds, extending their franchise record. The previous record was seven consecutive such games by Chris Bosh and Hassan Whiteside in November 2015.",
