    },
    {
      "id": "2121438232688599390",
      "text": "The theme all season has been whether the Heat have a closer. Giannis said Tuesday he thought it could be Klay. No Klay tonight. So is there a counter to Cavs' 3s and Donovan Mitchell and Harden?",
