      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2121437734384357752",
      "text": "After three quarters, the Heat have a 92-91 lead over the Cavaliers. Giannis Antetokounmpo has 31 points (14-of-17 FG) and nine rebounds to lead the Heat. Davion Mitchell has also added 14 points and 15 assists.",
